{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5507106545dbed6fd2d6db32027a69fc06f27748f8f67499631e76013deba105", "ja": "彼女の名は音速の……", "zh": "她的名字是音速的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2a88c36394a833cb802566fc081ae5a4cae1399fe44190d02f1a071fe1236d00", "ja": "それぞれ自分の不甲斐なさを吐露する2人。\n弱気になった紬を励ますプロデューサー\nだが、通りすがりの暴走族たちにあわや\n絡まれそうに。そこへ車で現れたのは、\nネタ探しに出ていたはずの歌織だった……。", "zh": "各自倾诉着自己的无能为力的2人。\n制作人鼓励着变得消沉的紬，\n却差点被路过的飞车党缠上。\n就在这时，开车出现的竟然是\n本应外出寻找素材的歌织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a675146ff31b9ca91260327994355513c88a1dfb6debbb5e4e23fea302684d33", "ja": "（仕事のため、泊りがけで金沢へ！　新幹線の\nチケットもあるし、あとはふたりを待つだけ……）", "zh": "（为了工作，要在金泽住一晚！新干线的车票也有了，接下来只要等她们两个就行了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "2adf524817ef0a637ad28e1b454b540da903b08f67c6139e64d2b543b402cf0a", "ja": "おはようございます、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "早安，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aceb43754830d3e53375f7a09f33b745786597a6783c60f615bebedf31f3bfef", "ja": "おはようございます。\n早いですね、歌織さん。", "zh": "早上好。\n真早啊，歌织小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "74eb9c8233a907958f9f9d5762abac558378eaffbb1c06c138baf06d1437b180", "ja": "はい、気合いが入ってますから♪　あの、今日は\nラジオのゲスト出演以外、予定はないんですよね？", "zh": "是的，因为我干劲十足嘛♪那个，今天除了去电台当嘉宾以外，就没有别的安排了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f7a870f789e8200a35c9cf903b040d0d4d231c2acdb4f222ce99dcd3bbf5d290", "ja": "ええ。明日は一日仕事なので、今日は\n自由時間にしようと思ってます。", "zh": "嗯。明天一整天都有工作，所以今天想安排成自由时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "429659c1c752e4f2522f64c65cc1d7b7b4589cc4a4da2ff8d761770333f4a246", "ja": "そうなんですね！　あの、紬ちゃんと\n{$P$}さんのご予定は……？", "zh": "原来如此！那个，紬和\n{$P$}先生有什么安排吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5b2c1860b07986eb57803e9a5fec2eb8adaed830770dd074690e93ecf6d06cf4", "ja": "紬は実家のご両親に呼ばれているそうで、\n顔だけ見せにいくと言っていました。", "zh": "听说紬被老家的父母叫回去了，说是只去让他们见上一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d92340228f34f723f596283cc9dda04b5188c00a790823d52067fb714d1e3714", "ja": "俺はラジオの後に一件打ち合わせがあるんですけど、\nそれが終わったらSNSのネタ探しに行こうかと……。", "zh": "我在广播结束后还有一个会议，等那边结束了，我想去找找SNS的素材……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "457a1044d576f5b465d8167ada4e763fb63e94a6b52193603d67f5c71d39db14", "ja": "ご家族との時間は大事ですものね。\nなら私、ひと足先にネタ探しをしてきます！", "zh": "和家人相处的时间很重要嘛。既然这样，我就先去找找素材！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "4db6f10958e716d5809413ba3b4d031a0b9886dbda7cd556ab48a6ccbad6f6d3", "ja": "パンフレットに載っているような有名なところなら、\nひとりでも回れると思いますし。", "zh": "如果是宣传册上介绍的那种知名景点，我想一个人也能逛逛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "da5d8c28c8fbef686f2a815042922c27428f652a73c0431d95db066f28c7caa0", "ja": "ひとりで大丈夫ですか？　打ち合わせが終わるまで\n待ってもらえれば、俺も一緒に……。", "zh": "一个人没问题吗？要是能等到商谈结束，我也可以一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "2366aa580d791b0c9bf69a4ac3511f24b6f0d444f83e40a54eab9c0addd3e724", "ja": "心配いりませんよ、{$P$}さん。\n私は、大人ですから。", "zh": "不用担心啦，{$P$}先生。\n毕竟我是个成年人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "090894718685b7c7225c1d91d3959ff47b0807799327bc1b5fad19ba647ca18a", "ja": "それに、紬ちゃんよりずっと年上ですし。本当なら、\nもっと引っ張ってあげなくちゃいけないのに……。", "zh": "而且，我也比紬大得多。本来应该更主动地带着她往前走才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "9bf444ace4427cd4295c3ba0cd8d56fc2ff156c782dfb868632174c8dad6ee60", "ja": "いいアイディアも思いつかないまま……。\nこのままじゃ、ダメだと思って。", "zh": "连好点子都想不出来……\n我就觉得，这样下去可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a22a9e75d1b45a7fbb461903c5ab538b18e651ee13a5d971d785c7688c13b8c0", "ja": "歌織さん……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "5838bdc77d6c432f660000813800f6e6d9eef88283e3207db67a9300e731ba5f", "ja": "紬ちゃんや紬ちゃんの地元パワーに頼るだけじゃなく。\n打開策のひとつやふたつ、必ず見つけてみせます！", "zh": "不能只依靠紬和紬家乡的力量。\n我一定会找到一两种解决问题的办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6db2004e77c788dd258c301b67023592878b8af08147408f4f27578831c45141", "ja": "……そういう事なら、わかりました。\nでも何かあったら、すぐ連絡してくださいね。", "zh": "……既然这样，我明白了。\n不过要是发生什么事，请马上联系我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "e36a63ad3672ffa7433b237f2e5eece145e4b9c14c41f1224a06fba4f167246e", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！", "zh": "好的，那是当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1018_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "10ccde78939f69edf0aee2d6a41f915bf6626582fbc98508449065694ccbafa9", "ja": "（ラジオのゲスト出演は予想外の反響！　打ち合わせは\n相手方が好感触で、少し長引いてしまった……）", "zh": "（电台嘉宾出演出乎意料地反响热烈！对方也很有兴趣，商谈不知不觉拖长了一点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3716064a12b98a342f41b40ad73e406f2a6e314ef7d82b22747d399587df3da2", "ja": "（さて、あっという間に夜だ。\n紬と歌織さんを迎えに行かなくちゃ）", "zh": "（那么，一转眼已经到晚上了。\n得去接紬和歌织小姐才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "37c95680529fdfeb922d10a45f64f46a3be7204d815ee6a909ccd995617623dd", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました。\n思ったより遅くなってしまってすみません。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了。\n比想象中晚了些，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "72d1261349a7cf7647b446d6b620b8132f5918d34a44ee0410c7fcafc0852908", "ja": "いいや、気にすることないよ。\n家族との時間は楽しめたか？", "zh": "不，没关系，不用在意。\n和家人相处得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b6bf98e839644a7604eb326bf1c5286892dc497305f85a0357dcedc3662d88ab", "ja": "はい、おかげさまで。\n……あの、桜守さんの姿が見えませんが？", "zh": "是的，多亏了您。\n……那个，怎么没看到樱守小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6db91fd9429930103f55498e416291d7cd1462b4878bf536eed7e5af6e688de3", "ja": "歌織さんは、ひとりでSNSのネタ探しに出てくれて\nいるんだ。そろそろ戻ってくるはずだよ。", "zh": "歌织小姐一个人出去找SNS素材了。差不多也该回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "797b29a56c40ce6af82ddec17684c636af41cda4c3182313784a9c0080a58952", "ja": "そうだったのですか。……やはり\n桜守さんは、優秀な上に勤勉な方なのですね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。……果然，樱守小姐不仅优秀，还是位勤奋的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "78e4e801a4264dea5cb5206ec977ce7c8f339dc536f7e1ca5a393c496a92213d", "ja": "それに比べて、私は策ひとつないまま……。\n愛想を尽かされないうちに、なんとか……！", "zh": "相比之下，我却连一个对策都没有……在被您彻底嫌弃之前，得想想办法才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "022b01acdca60bbaa805b1b2f17e8eb1002c4d622594b8e6ef110e1a935e3571", "ja": "そうか、なるほど……。\nお互いにそう思ってるなら、心配ないな。", "zh": "这样啊，原来如此……\n既然彼此都是这么想的，那就不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e5fe63b81e234aa56b4a02ff5cb74c5e1e1a1a8ad15d6a90d8b3ffa7b368d342", "ja": "歌織さんが言ってたんだ。「紬や紬の地元に頼らず、\n年上の自分がもっと頑張らなくちゃ」って。", "zh": "歌织小姐说过：“不能依靠紬或紬的家乡，作为年长者的我必须更加努力才行。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c585910849e6283d2dc236a8b9a449fb11fadd047f3ea80b145de43b7ca84690", "ja": "そんな……うちは、そんなこと……。", "zh": "怎么会……我、我哪有那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4ee4ff2a4d129edcd8346ad3e85f4fd6ada6896f2a0fb80e9a55e4c9d630834c", "ja": "お互い、同じ気持ちでこの仕事に取り組んでいるんだ。\n何かきっかけさえあれば、と思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我们都怀着同样的心情投入这份工作。\n要是能有个契机就好了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d216dc887ba00e7e5f09a8e3c75cf7452c20dc40cc9d7bbbc5cdee71635c16e4", "ja": "きっかけ……そうですね。\nけど、一体何が……。", "zh": "契机……是啊。\n不过，到底是什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d98db0433886d85a012237c69bbe83cd52dfe79330f6f59372ff0299b9aa76fc", "ja": "この時間ですと……夜景の綺麗な場所でしたら、\n案内できるかもしれませんが。", "zh": "这个时间的话……要是去看夜景漂亮的地方，或许我还能带路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1f89fffb8a471f744cc671156d99f6b46fad28ce32492cfc98136e2aeb9103f4", "ja": "なるほど。夜景はSNS映えするし、いいじゃないか！\n歌織さんが戻ってきたら早速……。", "zh": "原来如此。夜景很适合在社交平台上晒，挺不错的嘛！\n等歌织小姐回来就马上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1035_null", "source_sha256": "bcf0cfe2bd5e16fd8ccf1441922d3f98a85b2cb7460bb5c62b96033f07754118", "ja": "パラリラパラリラ～！！", "zh": "嗡啦嗡啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "559b56f7a294a4575180c9f2ecc517451e0dc65fec4c508c20cd4dd6e14a7d95", "ja": "！？\nあ、あれは……。", "zh": "！？那、那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0c7aeb2287f7f48daa5514bf6a70090d05cf83705d9e9eb44796e701aebb1a75", "ja": "もしかして……暴走族か？\nまだいるんだな、ああいうの……。", "zh": "难道是……暴走族吗？\n那种人原来现在还有啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1038_bikera", "source_sha256": "0246894e6b5e3a3bc18dea1edd9c3a65adb84f50be3d294ad72cbbf1e0593235", "ja": "ふう、ここまで来ればもう大丈夫やろ……。\n気を取り直して、ここで大暴れといくか！", "zh": "呼，到了这里应该就没事了吧……。\n重新振作一下，接下来就在这里大闹一场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1039_bikerb", "source_sha256": "f8d9e2e10fe20780128411eee8b6da1bfea78f60a710420cdd68ae2b7f4fc190", "ja": "おうよ！　……ん？　駅前で女連れ……\nチャラチャラしよって、だらなこと！", "zh": "好嘞！……嗯？在车站前带着女伴……吊儿郎当的，真不像话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "4f148f8d0e1b86c05004d8a733b2c6edbe30df70ae276278f3b205c545c608b4", "ja": "しまった……こっちに近づいてくるな。\n紬、俺の後ろに隠れて。離れないように。", "zh": "糟糕……别往这边靠近。\n紬，躲到我身后。别离开我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1041_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8c1ddf990f1db29f50fd4adec7836eb9ac0b8124b1b0bf034fba00efb4fb968d", "ja": "は、はい……っ！", "zh": "是、是的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1042_null", "source_sha256": "a53f2959d0bd67a87b22869328255deac5a9c088662ec6bbdf1229e418a7d843", "ja": "ブウン……！", "zh": "嗡……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1043_bikera", "source_sha256": "e0a70d7bb2ea0566947dbe1deb8ea41b32d875135bab2794511dbf113901b882", "ja": "！？　お、おい……！\nあの青い車、さっきのヤベーやつか……！？", "zh": "！？喂、喂……！\n那辆蓝色的车，难道就是刚才那个危险的家伙吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1044_bikerb", "source_sha256": "98d917e300a54c648e216c2465df23f8eb3c6414793bcd53fbdc78d6acdad551", "ja": "な、なに！？　……はっ、よく見りゃレンタカー\nでねえか！　びびっとんじゃ………………え？", "zh": "什、什么！？……啊，仔细一看，这不是辆租来的车吗！吓我一跳……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1045_null", "source_sha256": "8b54693877ee97a09c9e25bb1b7c52bccb1efbad61749fe01c681d50081f43ce", "ja": "ガチャ……", "zh": "咔嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1046_052kao", "source_sha256": "c2047175cbeab7ce1ec4f6c355f476dc5b518353237182f08c313584b2f7f69d", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、紬ちゃん。\n遅れてしまってごめんなさい。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，还有紬。\n抱歉我迟到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "5b2e91d15b2cbe4ddc1f3d3204aee743a9ac0966b32a71ff7b11858b1719773f", "ja": "歌織さん……！？\nあの、レンタカー、借りてたんですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐……！？\n那个，您租车了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "0aace72eab7bfa94c0af1d38f20e50de051efd72cc05b779e313ea71d00e68e8", "ja": "ええ。行ってみたい場所が\nたくさんあったので、車のほうが早いかと……。", "zh": "是的。因为有很多想去的地方，所以想着开车或许会更快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1049_bikera", "source_sha256": "88dda5f821a3f637a44e70f76acee03513e11f37e5a39de8b48829fc94cd671a", "ja": "あの可憐なひとが、さっきの攻めた走りを……？", "zh": "那个楚楚可怜的人，刚才居然跑得那么激进……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1050_bikerb", "source_sha256": "f9bd8371287e2d2c6993f08fda815acdb28b39adc0dda46f53fe89ce4c16cc07", "ja": "……なんて美しいんだ……。\nいや、そうじゃねえ！", "zh": "……多么美丽啊……\n不对，不是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1051_bikerb", "source_sha256": "0614c2c5bf7738c90dbb9bbce3022396974040861ee2e8c40007ad0b8e411080", "ja": "レンタカーに舐められっぱなしではいられん！\nお前も乗り込め、もっかい勝負や！", "zh": "可不能一直被租来的车小看啊！\n你也上车，再比一场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1052_052kao", "source_sha256": "fe26eaae4bc5cf384b68a4556643c5a249963800adb4601b3fa66ff57a5987af", "ja": "お相手、まだやる気みたい。それなら……\n紬ちゃん、ナビをお願いできる？", "zh": "对方好像还想继续。既然这样……小紬，能帮忙导航吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1053_051tmg", "source_sha256": "707729fcd84df79caa61a5c88b37eb12db48fae3a79d60d11719d6f6522d7094", "ja": "は……。\nナビ、と言いますと？", "zh": "哈……  \n您说的导航，是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1054_052kao", "source_sha256": "9f7d431b61e33bf8dfe2ff00a32de5320a47c49c48ef009efd1ccf935595bdb3", "ja": "一番近い高速までの案内を。\nこの辺りの道は、紬ちゃんに聞くのが一番だもの。", "zh": "请带我去最近的高速公路。毕竟，这一带的路还是问紬最清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "a0de15013a324be6f29044091f17e7020fb70bae367cf14ad0fdf3310f1c27f7", "ja": "あの、まさか歌織さん……。", "zh": "那个，难道歌织小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1056_052kao", "source_sha256": "06a1254e84cc93cdc67dd69ba211f502314e35af9dd19ac2dc6fe4ec87d248d7", "ja": "さぁ、ふたりとも乗ってください。しっかり\n振り切らないと、追ってきてしまいますから。", "zh": "来吧，你们两个都上来。要是不彻底甩开他们，他们还会继续追上来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1057_052kao", "source_sha256": "4cc183878fe37e6f1c1826e5a82e83558f101f37c20f72bba1323bf4b9183d1c", "ja": "それじゃあ……全力でいきますよ！", "zh": "那么……我们要全力冲刺了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1058_null", "source_sha256": "05817674cb5e2d92f8e1b006c8b8e8b97219b38999c65e6451675d1eca7856c6", "ja": "ブロロ……ブウン、ブウンッ！！\nギャルルルルルッッ！！！！", "zh": "轰隆……轰——轰！！  \n轰噜噜噜噜！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_04_1059_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8b5114c9fe4e64ba437431062af6395b3613f9c73b0af87c2fd94f59fc5d7107", "ja": "ひっ……！\nきゃああああああああっ！？", "zh": "咿……！\n呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
